<title>INDIA: India VSNL GDR issue price in late March.</title>
<headline>India VSNL GDR issue price in late March.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian telcommunications firm Videsh Sanchar Nigam Ltd (VSNL) will price its 37.8 million Global Depositary Receipts (GDRs) issue around March 25, a company official said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
